==================================================
You are playing Hanabi-Full-CardKnowledge, a cooperative card game where you must work with your teammates to build fireworks.

## GAME HISTORY (Previous Turns)

**Turn 5:**
- You gave a RANK hint (1) to player 1

**Turn 5:**
- You gave a COLOR hint (Y) to player 1
- Used 1 information token(s)

